OL,3,GNEWSAAvian flu and costs among reasons
OL,4,Afor loss of captive birds at Castle
OL,5,AEspie
OL,6,
OL,7,FAvian flu, cost-cutting and Brexit are
OL,8,Famong the reasons behind the transfer
OL,9,Fof captive birds from one of Northern
OL,10,FIreland's best-known wildlife sites,
OL,11,Faccording to the charity that runs it.
OL,13,FDirector of Operations at Wildfowl and
OL,14,FWetlands Trust (WWT) Alex Lane said
OL,15,Favian influenza, as well as
OL,16,Fdifficulties in transporting birds
OL,17,Fsince Brexit, has contributed to the
OL,18,Fdecline in the number of captive birds
OL,19,Fat Castle Espie.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
