OL,3,GNEWSAAvian flu and costs among reasons
OL,4,Afor loss of captive birds at Castle
OL,5,AEspie
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe closure of both the site's captive
OL,8,Fbird programme and guided school tour
OL,9,Fprogramme is part of wider WWT
OL,10,Fcost-cutting measures.
OL,12,FAn Assembly member has described the
OL,13,Fchanges to the education offering as
OL,14,F"disappointing".
